@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Shawn

rectangle "Gym Buddy\nAndroid App" as App {
  component "Workout UI" as UI
  component "Realtime Biomechanics Engine" as Engine
  component "Local Data Layer" as Local
}

rectangle "Android Device" {
  component "CameraX / Camera" as Camera
  component "Android TextToSpeech\nOFFLINE VOICE ONLY" as TTS
  component "Health Connect" as HC
}

database "Room / SQLite\nLocal-only" as DB
rectangle "RENPHO / Health Apps" as Renpho
rectangle "GitHub\ncode/docs/synthetic only" as GitHub
rectangle "Google Drive\nspecs/reports/builds only" as Drive

Shawn --> UI : selects exercise\nstarts/stops set
Camera --> Engine : video frames
Engine --> UI : overlay + metrics
Engine --> TTS : short live cues\nonly when offline voice available
Engine --> Local : buffered telemetry + results
Local --> DB : persist locally
HC --> Local : optional health context
Renpho --> HC : optional upstream sync

App ..x GitHub : no personal-data path
App ..x Drive : no personal-data path

note right of App
  Hard constraints:
  - Works in airplane mode for workout monitoring
  - No backend required
  - No LLM required
  - No account/login system
  - No video upload
  - Single user
  - Manual exercise selection
  - Pose model bundled with APK; no runtime model download
  - MVP SHALL NOT request android.permission.INTERNET
  - MVP SHALL NOT implement personal-data export/share
end note

note bottom of TTS
  Select only a locally installed voice that does not
  require a network connection. If unavailable,
  fall back to visual cues instead of network TTS.
end note

note bottom of DB
  Real Gym Buddy personal data stays on-device.
  Android cloud backup is disabled.
end note

@enduml
